    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d241">

                <pb facs="0307" n="1041" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1041"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Buck to Mr. Bayard.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Lima, Peru</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-09-18"><hi rendition="#italic">September 18,
                        1885</hi></date>. (Received October 15.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 31.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: On the 16th instant I addressed a note to
                    the foreign office, of which I inclose copy, urging the claim of members of the
                    Hydrographic Commission of the River Amazon, according to instructions in
                    Department’s No. 119, to Mr. Phelps.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chas. W. Buck.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d241-a1.xml" xpointer="d241-a1"/>
            </div>
